@page "/lifecycle"

<PageTitle>Deja — the OnInitialized contract</PageTitle>

<h1>Lifecycle</h1>
<p class="lead">
    A component overriding <code>OnInitialized</code> must call <code>base.OnInitialized()</code> —
    that call runs the scan that attaches declared <code>Query&lt;T&gt;</code> and
    <code>Mutation&lt;T&gt;</code> state. Both panels below run the same fetch; the second one
    skips the base call. Forgetting it compiles and renders once, so
    <code>DejaComponentBase</code> detects the skipped call and logs a console error naming the
    component — open the browser console (F12) to see it.
</p>

